  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the proposed project is to reduce emissions of N2O, a powerful greenhouse gas, which would, in the absence of the project, have been emitted into the atmosphere contributing to the damaging effects of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
